{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dimakerus</strong> is a <strong>PvPvE</strong> <i>top-down slasher</i> where <strong>Dungeon-crawling</strong> meets <strong>Social-deduction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/fb21f7fdc0e6c372ce1b6dffc9d1420e.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/fb21f7fdc0e6c372ce1b6dffc9d1420e.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/fb21f7fdc0e6c372ce1b6dffc9d1420e.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISGUISE AS ANY CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in plain sight by disguising as peasants, guards, statues, captains and even <u>kings</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/74294650d6a8b8b0cf5c044e86024412.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1288 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/74294650d6a8b8b0cf5c044e86024412.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/74294650d6a8b8b0cf5c044e86024412.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY THE ACT</strong><br>It is all about bluffing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular guards are easy to deceive, but you'll have to put up an impression to convince other <strong>players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a8fd39a390e767da44b047191bb5a690.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1288 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a8fd39a390e767da44b047191bb5a690.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a8fd39a390e767da44b047191bb5a690.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY PLAYER IS AN IMPOSTOR</strong><br>You've got no friends here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every other player is also in disguise, hunting you while you hunt them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/401926227be1dba9c26c50794148c434.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/401926227be1dba9c26c50794148c434.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/401926227be1dba9c26c50794148c434.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR WAY UP THE RANKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to new rooms by acquiring higher-rank disguises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/794d62592c159317f614fcd9a7341e99.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/794d62592c159317f614fcd9a7341e99.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/794d62592c159317f614fcd9a7341e99.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BURDEN THE WEIGHT OF THE CROWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it the <strong>greed of men</strong> has awakened the <i>Colossi</i> wrath. Those who take possession of the <strong>crown</strong> shall forever be under the shadow of the <u>Hand of Fate</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/55d35286a9f348cb54427e00ab00db27.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/55d35286a9f348cb54427e00ab00db27.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/55d35286a9f348cb54427e00ab00db27.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LUX IN TENEBRIS CLARIUS LUCET</strong><br>the light shines brighter in the dark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape their imminent demise, players must wander through the depths of long-lost Roman catacombs and be at the mercy of their dwellers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/d0745f15ab7ac2657ae787e93cd3bc96.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/d0745f15ab7ac2657ae787e93cd3bc96.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/d0745f15ab7ac2657ae787e93cd3bc96.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DARK SHORTCUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you having a bad time trying to reach the crown in the guarded room? Try to find a way through the hidden chambers. Beware \u2014 the folk of these lands believe these places to be haunted \u2014 nah, just old wives\u2019 tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a9f4b49f84456bf79ad50c841bb1c777.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1288 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a9f4b49f84456bf79ad50c841bb1c777.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a9f4b49f84456bf79ad50c841bb1c777.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAW UPON THE RELICS' POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear not the darkness, for all is not lost. Deep down the ruins of the ancient world one might find relics of power. One can wield their power to subdue their enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But heed my warning, those artifacts are not to be toyed with\u00a0\u2014 for they may alter the balance of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/3fd0d80c40cc7bd8c77908097a8ea09b.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/3fd0d80c40cc7bd8c77908097a8ea09b.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/3fd0d80c40cc7bd8c77908097a8ea09b.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IGNIS</strong> <strong>ET\u00a0SANGUIS</strong><br>fire and blood</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of a vast arsenal to deceive, track, ambush and bring demise to your <span class=\"bb_strike\">friends</span>\u00a0enemies!<br>A disguised player may be hard to track down \u2014 try using a <u>Khopesh</u> sickle to inflict bleeding effect leaving a fresh trail of blood for you to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isn't that pile of coins next to a bush too suspicious? Throw your <u>Paramachaera</u> claymore towards the bush and find out who is sneaking behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be mindful not to step on an inflammable oil puddle with a <u>Torch</u>\u00a0in your hand \u2014 players tend to use pyromaniac strategies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911340?t=1770593476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/dda61b5ac44c51351a18584b81ee1e5bda3a82b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770593476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/8dca48a3ce634439d3230ec153c47dbdfc6d1202/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770593476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/8dca48a3ce634439d3230ec153c47dbdfc6d1202/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770593476","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3886580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dimakerus</strong> is a <strong>PvPvE</strong> <i>top-down slasher</i> where <strong>Dungeon-crawling</strong> meets <strong>Social-deduction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/fb21f7fdc0e6c372ce1b6dffc9d1420e.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/fb21f7fdc0e6c372ce1b6dffc9d1420e.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/fb21f7fdc0e6c372ce1b6dffc9d1420e.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISGUISE AS ANY CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in plain sight by disguising as peasants, guards, statues, captains and even <u>kings</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/74294650d6a8b8b0cf5c044e86024412.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1288 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/74294650d6a8b8b0cf5c044e86024412.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/74294650d6a8b8b0cf5c044e86024412.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY THE ACT</strong><br>It is all about bluffing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular guards are easy to deceive, but you'll have to put up an impression to convince other <strong>players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a8fd39a390e767da44b047191bb5a690.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1288 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a8fd39a390e767da44b047191bb5a690.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a8fd39a390e767da44b047191bb5a690.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY PLAYER IS AN IMPOSTOR</strong><br>You've got no friends here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every other player is also in disguise, hunting you while you hunt them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/401926227be1dba9c26c50794148c434.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/401926227be1dba9c26c50794148c434.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/401926227be1dba9c26c50794148c434.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR WAY UP THE RANKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to new rooms by acquiring higher-rank disguises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/794d62592c159317f614fcd9a7341e99.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/794d62592c159317f614fcd9a7341e99.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/794d62592c159317f614fcd9a7341e99.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BURDEN THE WEIGHT OF THE CROWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it the <strong>greed of men</strong> has awakened the <i>Colossi</i> wrath. Those who take possession of the <strong>crown</strong> shall forever be under the shadow of the <u>Hand of Fate</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/55d35286a9f348cb54427e00ab00db27.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1228 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/55d35286a9f348cb54427e00ab00db27.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/55d35286a9f348cb54427e00ab00db27.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LUX IN TENEBRIS CLARIUS LUCET</strong><br>the light shines brighter in the dark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape their imminent demise, players must wander through the depths of long-lost Roman catacombs and be at the mercy of their dwellers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/d0745f15ab7ac2657ae787e93cd3bc96.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/d0745f15ab7ac2657ae787e93cd3bc96.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/d0745f15ab7ac2657ae787e93cd3bc96.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DARK SHORTCUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you having a bad time trying to reach the crown in the guarded room? Try to find a way through the hidden chambers. Beware \u2014 the folk of these lands believe these places to be haunted \u2014 nah, just old wives\u2019 tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a9f4b49f84456bf79ad50c841bb1c777.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1288 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a9f4b49f84456bf79ad50c841bb1c777.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/a9f4b49f84456bf79ad50c841bb1c777.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAW UPON THE RELICS' POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear not the darkness, for all is not lost. Deep down the ruins of the ancient world one might find relics of power. One can wield their power to subdue their enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But heed my warning, those artifacts are not to be toyed with\u00a0\u2014 for they may alter the balance of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/3fd0d80c40cc7bd8c77908097a8ea09b.poster.avif?t=1770593476\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/3fd0d80c40cc7bd8c77908097a8ea09b.webm?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/extras/3fd0d80c40cc7bd8c77908097a8ea09b.mp4?t=1770593476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IGNIS</strong> <strong>ET\u00a0SANGUIS</strong><br>fire and blood</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of a vast arsenal to deceive, track, ambush and bring demise to your <span class=\"bb_strike\">friends</span>\u00a0enemies!<br>A disguised player may be hard to track down \u2014 try using a <u>Khopesh</u> sickle to inflict bleeding effect leaving a fresh trail of blood for you to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isn't that pile of coins next to a bush too suspicious? Throw your <u>Paramachaera</u> claymore towards the bush and find out who is sneaking behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be mindful not to step on an inflammable oil puddle with a <u>Torch</u>\u00a0in your hand \u2014 players tend to use pyromaniac strategies.</p>","developers":["Triunviratus Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911340/1b899a561875137fe7a81db198a6008151cb5f71/header.jpg?t=1770593476","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1911340/855687011/eefc06b1f43b428b00e8087219fa67759782107d/1765753215/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765754396","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1911340/855687011/eefc06b1f43b428b00e8087219fa67759782107d/1765753215/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765754396","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1911340/855687011/eefc06b1f43b428b00e8087219fa67759782107d/1765753215/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765754396","id":257191131,"name":"Dimakerus Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191131/b86a76afd77038542db2d3652e04e9f5cad7fae8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765754396"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1911340/1094853617/613627d3e15c4ba13e818a1ddc61e9cc40719460/1769862734/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769863971","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1911340/1094853617/613627d3e15c4ba13e818a1ddc61e9cc40719460/1769862734/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769863971","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1911340/1094853617/613627d3e15c4ba13e818a1ddc61e9cc40719460/1769862734/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769863971","id":257153662,"name":"Dimakerus Demo Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153662/81b2aba5bdbf1fc505124aa0d360fd912aa3adb8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769863971"}],"name":"Dimakerus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS